sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Order svc
  participant DB as Orders DB
  participant R as Relay
  participant K as Broker
  participant C as Shipping
  S->>DB: one tx: order + outbox row
  R->>DB: claim batch (SKIP LOCKED)
  R->>K: publish, key = order id
  K-->>R: ack
  R->>DB: mark published
  K->>C: deliver (at least once)
  C->>C: one tx: inbox row + change
